# Unsummon: "Return target creature to its owner's hand." At instant speed, in response to Lightning Bolt aimed at
# Bot1's Ornithopter, Bot1 returns it to hand. The Bolt's only target is gone, so it is countered on resolution
# (CR 608.2b) and deals no damage: Ornithopter is in Bot1's hand, not the graveyard, Bot2 spent the Bolt for nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Unsummon
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsummon
Bot1.Hand = Ornithopter; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Life = 20
Stack.Count = 0
